NexPlay is game night for the group chat. You open a room, share a five letter code, and everyone is at the same table in seconds: Ayo with seeds you can watch being sown, Whot with the house rules your family argues about, plus Connect Four, Tic Tac Toe, Rock Paper Scissors, Word Race, Quick Math and Trivia for up to eight players.

The rebuild was about trust and flow. Every game is a pure state machine with its own tests and computer players, the host's device referees the match through Firebase Realtime Database, and strict database rules keep private cards and answers private. Rooms expire when nobody uses them, a dropped host is replaced automatically, and an end to end test suite plays every game and mode to the finish on desktop and mobile.
